@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Tip a seller - Lively Help Center";
    ViewData["CategorySlug"] = "Buying";
    ViewData["SubCategorySlug"] = "Buying items";
    ViewData["HeroTitle"] = "Tip a seller";
    ViewData["HeroStyle"] = "background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.4), rgba(0,0,0,0.4)), url('/help_centre_img/help_area/help_centre_hero_bg.png');";
    ViewData["IsArticle"] = true;
}

<div class="article-detail-page">
    <div class="article-body">

        <p>Want to show support beyond buying? You can tip your favorite sellers directly in the Lively app as a quick way to say thank you.</p>

        <p><strong>On this page:</strong></p>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="#check-if-you-can-tip">Check if you can tip a seller</a></li>
            <li><a href="#tipping-guidelines">Tipping guidelines</a></li>
            <li><a href="#tip-from-live-show">How to tip from a live show</a></li>
            <li><a href="#tip-from-profile">How to tip from a seller's profile</a></li>
            <li><a href="#view-tipping-history">View your tipping history</a></li>
        </ul>

        <hr />

        <h2 id="check-if-you-can-tip">Check if you can tip a seller</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Tipping is only available in the Lively app.</li>
            <li>You and the seller must both be in the same country</li>
            <li>To tip a seller within a show, you must have purchased from the seller's shop before</li>
        </ul>

        <hr />

        <h2 id="tipping-guidelines">Tipping guidelines</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>You can tip between <strong>₦/$/ £/€1–₦2,000</strong> depending on your location</li>
            <li>
                There's a <strong>daily limit</strong> of:
                <ul>
                    <li>₦/$/ £/€200 or 10 tips per seller, per livestream</li>
                    <li>₦/$/ £/€500 in total tips per day</li>
                </ul>
            </li>
            <li>Tips are nonrefundable</li>
            <li>Buyers (tippers) cover payment processing fees, which are shown before you confirm the tip</li>
            <li>You can only tip using Lively's in-built tip functionality (the methods in this article)</li>
            <li>Tips can't be used to avoid fees or sell products. Doing so may result in account action for the buyer and seller.</li>
            <li>Tips messages must follow Lively's <a asp-action="Index" asp-controller="Home">Community Guidelines</a>. To report one, go to the person's profile and use the <a asp-action="Index" asp-controller="Home">report tool</a>.</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="text-center my-4">
            <img src="/help_centre_img/help_area/Tipping_guidelines.png"
                 alt="Tipping guidelines screen in Lively app"
                 class="img-fluid" style="border-radius: 12px;" />
        </div>

        <hr />

        <div class="helpful-widget">
            <p>Was this article helpful?</p>
            <div class="helpful-buttons">
                <button type="button">Yes</button>
                <button type="button">No</button>
            </div>
            <span>80 out of 145 found this helpful</span>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>